# Fixed defect 350, 2026-10-05 (lane b12-parse12; found by lane b11-parse
# beside defects 267 and 343). Symptom: the resolver said its reports through
# `r.out.diagnostics @ r.out.diagnostics.push(d)`, and `resolve/cycles` its
# own through `out.diagnostics`, field places the in-place store never
# reaches, so every report copied every one said before it: 2,000 constant
# cycles took 4.74 billion instructions retired and 2,000 unknown names 7.39.
# Cause and repair: the list is lent to `state.append_diagnostic`, whose
# parameter is a bare place, as every parser site does since defect 146; the
# same 2,000 cycles now retire 3.90 billion and the unknown names 6.55. The
# three sites below are the resolver's and both of `cycles`'s; the checker's
# is `fixedbugs-350-a-checkers-report-is-said-in-place`, and the lowering's,
# a net no program reaches since the checker refuses the range first, has no
# case. Nothing said moves.

constant A: i64  #~ constant_cycle
    B

constant B: i64
    A

constant C: i64
    len(args())  #~ constant_body

function f(n: i64) -> i64
    return n + missing  #~ unknown_name

function main()
    print(f(1))
